<title>GREECE: CRETABANK SETS RATES ON FOREX LOANS.</title>
<headline>CRETABANK SETS RATES ON FOREX LOANS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cretabank announced the following</p>
<p>prime rates for foreign currency loans effective Monday August</p>
<p>18:</p>
<p>Cretabank reviews its lending rates weekly.</p>
<p>    US Dollars   :  7.50 percent</p>
<p>    Ecu	    :  6.23 percent</p>
<p>    Mark	   :  5.33 percent</p>
<p>    Yen	    :  2.72 percent</p>
<p>Swiss franc  :  3.68 percent</p>
<p>French franc :  3.52 percent</p>
<p>Italian lira :  8.60 percent</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
